  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KawiSafi II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KawiSafi II is an equity fund intending to utilize a blended finance structure to unlock commercial climate investment capital in the African region. 



&#x2022; It provides an access to a diversified portfolio of early stage start-ups in multiple sectors that are innovating low- and zero-carbon technologies, in the target countries. The Fund has appropriate limits on investments and industry concentration to ensure risk diversification.  
&#x2022; It supports clean technology investments in Sub Saharan&#xa0;Africa through blended equity fund structure that&#xa0;derisks&#xa0;commercial capital.?
&#x2022; It has an unique structure where GCF concessionality is designed to directly catalyze commercial investors, while public capital does not benefit from such a concessionality.</narrative>
  </description>
